<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσίλ-ειον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσιλ-ήϊον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kingly
				dwelling, palace,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.3
			</span></i>, etc.; more common in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1352a11
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>seat of empire, capital,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.15.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>royal treasury,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.149
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tiara, diadem,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, Roussel <i>Cultes Égyptiens</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				233
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				90.45
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rosetta</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.358d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Horap.
				1.15
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ β. τῆς εὐπρεπείας</span>
			<i>diadem</i> of beauty, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλιμος</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.91
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκόϊον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.123
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βασίλεια, τά,</span>
			<i>festival of Zeus Basileus,</i> in Boeotia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.552
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).78
			</span></i>; at Olbia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				1.105
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
